{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software is a support application to exchange databases of RPG Maker MV and RPG Maker MZ into Excel or </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CSV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can write RPG Maker's database and events into datasheets for Excel or CSV, and read</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >them. You can use this software for purposes such as below:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parameter adjustment to give an overview of database</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit database and events efficiently and with high flexibility by using formula, format and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Port data or events to other project</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Output Object Data listed below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfDatabase:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input / output existing database. The file name is Database.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extension will be applied to fit the output format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tileset and common event do no apply. Independently defined data (referred to from the script)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can be input / output as well.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfCommon Event:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input / output executed contents of common event,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The file name is CommonEvents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfMap Event:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input / output executed contents of map event.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The file name is MapXXX.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event ID and Event Page will be output in sheet name</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1171220?t=1755498080","background_raw":"https://store.akama